This app bundles no third-party code. Its page (ui/dist/index.mjs) imports
React, React DOM, lucide-react, TanStack Query and the Kiro Crew app SDK from
the Kiro Crew dashboard that hosts it, and its backend uses the aiohttp that
Kiro Crew's own Python environment provides; none of them is copied into this
repository. Songs play on third-party websites in Kiro Crew's browser, under
those sites' own terms.
